[SIZE=5]► Important Technical Notes[/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Java 25+ Required:[/B] This plugin is built for the future of Minecraft and requires modern Java environments.
[*][B]Unique Server IDs:[/B] You **must** set a unique `server-id` for each server (e.g., "lobby-1", "survival").
[*][B]Managed Database Best Practices:[/B] For production use, we recommend creating a dedicated database user with restricted permissions (SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, CREATE, ALTER).
[/LIST]
